&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Calibri;"&gt;Our short-term borrowing capacity with WEC Energy Group is $150.0 million. Short-term &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Calibri;"&gt;borrowings&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Calibri;"&gt; bear interest computed at the average stated interest rate payable on commercial paper &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Calibri;"&gt;issued&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Calibri;"&gt; by WEC Energy Group. Short-term debt is callable by WEC Energy Group at any time.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
