&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 5pt; page-break-inside: avoid; page-break-after: avoid; widows: 0; orphans: 0; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Calibri;"&gt;Realized gains and losses on derivatives are recorded in cost of sales upon settlement; however, they may be subsequently deferred for future rate recovery or refund as the gains and losses are included in our fuel and natural gas cost recovery mechanisms. Our realized gains and the estimated notional volumes related to these settlements were as follows:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
