                  <td style="width: 359.5px;">Payments for ATC's transmission infrastructure upgrades that will be reimbursed</td>
                  <td style="width: 359.5px; text-align: right;">(2,750,890)</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                  <td style="width: 359.5px;">Other investing activities, net</td>
                  <td style="width: 359.5px; text-align: right;">$&#160; &#160;(3,123,437)</td>
                </tr>
              </tbody>
            </table>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="ps__rail-y" style="display: block; opacity: 0.9; transition: width 0.2s linear, opacity 0.2s linear, background-color 0.2s linear; width: 10px; cursor: default; top: 0px; height: 200px; background-image: none !important; background-position: initial !important; background-size: initial !important; background-repeat: initial !important; background-attachment: initial !important; background-origin: initial !important; background-clip: initial !important; left: auto !important;">&#160;</div>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" xlink:from="HHB2781977E01F0A0371F85F182ED1CBD2" xlink:to="HH9242F0CF09F1BDF645D6515025C7260B" order="1" />
    <link:loc xlink:type="locator" xlink:href="#HH4F0972D44EB2DF5C9B18B66CA21D3A98" xlink:label="HH4F0972D44EB2DF5C9B18B66CA21D3A98" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="HHD0E33816E856A831F16AD3103DBE24C1" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <p>332 L1a</p>
        <p>Network transmission is billed by ATC (billing agent), but is reported under MISO since MISO is the transmission provider; ATC acts as the billing agent in order to facilitate the billing process.</p>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" xlink:from="HH4F0972D44EB2DF5C9B18B66CA21D3A98" xlink:to="HHD0E33816E856A831F16AD3103DBE24C1" order="1" />
    <link:loc xlink:type="locator" xlink:href="#HHC68B48F57C6263ABB0790F93B334CE96" xlink:label="HHC68B48F57C6263ABB0790F93B334CE96" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="HH3E46214017332DCEB266FA6F4A8105B5" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <p>332 L1g</p>
        <p>Other charges consist of Schedule 2 (Reactive Supply &amp; Voltage Control), Schedule 26 (Network Upgrade), Schedule 26A (Multi-Value Project Cost Recovery), Schedule 26D (Cost Recovery for Targeted Market Efficiency Projhects-PJM), Schedule 26E (Cost Recover for Interregional Market Efficiency Projects), Schedule 33 (Blackstart Service),Unreserved Use Revenue, and Attachment BB Reimbursement.&#160;&#160;</p>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" xlink:from="HHC68B48F57C6263ABB0790F93B334CE96" xlink:to="HH3E46214017332DCEB266FA6F4A8105B5" order="1" />
    <link:loc xlink:type="locator" xlink:href="#HH15D5B9EE8AAC1CEC722A98B8F11DA1D7" xlink:label="HH15D5B9EE8AAC1CEC722A98B8F11DA1D7" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="HHCE7D2D320056FFB97C2DC0034E0269D7" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <p>300 12d</p>
        <p>Includes 3,276 MWH relating to unbilled revenues.</p>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" xlink:from="HH15D5B9EE8AAC1CEC722A98B8F11DA1D7" xlink:to="HHCE7D2D320056FFB97C2DC0034E0269D7" order="1" />
    <link:loc xlink:type="locator" xlink:href="#HH758BDA2145DDCA2671E4199E034485DF" xlink:label="HH758BDA2145DDCA2671E4199E034485DF" />
